    7 method_decl: type IDENTIFIER LPAREN param_list RPAREN block
    8            | VOID IDENTIFIER LPAREN param_list RPAREN block
    9            | type IDENTIFIER LPAREN param_list RPAREN EXTERN SEMICOLON
   10            | VOID IDENTIFIER LPAREN param_list RPAREN EXTERN SEMICOLON

   11 param_list: /* empty */
